Subject: [PATCH] nss: own unpublished connection-table DMA and dispatch by token

Separate CE/CME allocation and mapping from firmware publication. Roll
back only private resources, using the original DMA mapping tuple.
Retain any firmware-exposed table until a stop/drain contract exists.
Do not use firmware callback pointers for SIZE and CFG replies.

This is host-side containment, not NSS firmware retirement support.

